# yadm ignore rules for $HOME. THIS DOTFILES REPO IS PUBLIC — anything tracked here
# is world-readable, so work-specific context must never enter it.

# Issue-tracker caches: contain employer email addresses, internal ticket text, and
# secret *paths* (not values). Per-project and re-fetchable, so never worth versioning.
.beads/

# Untracked: names the very strings the guard blocks, so it cannot be public.
.config/yadm/blocked-patterns
.config/yadm/private.env
